图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A three-column glass UI for deepseek-harness, delivered as installable packages instead of a fork.","id":"gh:1381228784","install_available":false,"language":"HTML","name":"dsh-beyond-glass","slug":"LeoEthanZ/dsh-beyond-glass","topics":["cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","skin","theme","wallpaper"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A three-column glass UI for deepseek-harness, delivered as installable packages instead of a fork."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Beyond Glass"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A three-column glass UI for deepseek-harness,\ndelivered as **a set of installable packages**. No for"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"k, no patching: six packages mount into\na profile of their own, and removing them puts you back wher"},{"id":"p3s3","text":": six packages mount into\na profile of their own, and removing them puts you back where you started."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"中文说明 →"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Live gallery →** — all nine wallpapers in one\npage, switchable, with the fluid field running live "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"around the frame. The window plays nine\nseconds of the shell on the way in — folding a column away, "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"changing wallpaper, switching on\nthe data island — and hands straight back to a still. Scroll back u"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"p to it, or try another\nwallpaper and return to that one, and it plays again."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- The three blocks\n- Design\n- Install: no harness yet / the harness is already installed\n- What is i"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"n the packages, what is not\n- Compatibility · License"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## The three blocks"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Block | What it is | Packages |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **Glass shell** | The three-column frame — brand rail, left column, right column, all on transluce"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"nt panels | `ui-layout` `ui-sidebar` `ui-sidebar-right` |\n| **Launcher** | The centre panel of the h"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ome view: category grid, app cards, and the dashboard behind immersive mode | `ui-workbench` |\n| **W"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"allpaper** | The wallpaper picker in the right column, plus the glass token sheet every panel reads "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"allpaper picker in the right column, plus the glass token sheet every panel reads | `ui-wallpaper` |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Only the `harness` package is a profile layer; the other five are mounted by the rows it patches."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Design"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### The glass shell"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The left column carries identity and navigation (brand wordmark, new-session / launcher,\ncategory tr"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ee, session list, API account). The centre is the launcher. The right column is the\ncurrent workspac"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"e: sessions, wallpaper, and whatever other panels register into it. All three sit\non one set of glas"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"s tokens — a translucent gradient, `backdrop-filter: blur(28px) saturate(1.8)`,\nand a 0.5px outline."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The left column collapses to an icon rail, the right column folds away entirely, and the wallpaper\ns"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"hows through underneath."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The right column is a workspace rather than a fixed panel: it can be sessions, it can be wallpaper,\n"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"it can be any panel another plugin registers into it (below: a plugin market)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Wallpaper"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The 极境壁纸 panel offers two families: **four procedural fluids** (深海流光, 极光翡翠, 紫晶云海,\n熔金暮色) and **five m"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"otion landscapes** (雾隐森林, 潮汐漫游, 雪峰天际, 雪岭电影感, 雪野滑踪)."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The fluids are drawn in the page and need no network. The landscapes are video and need a network\non"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" first play (the panel marks them 需要联网). Footage from Coverr —\nfree for commercial use, no attributi"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"(the panel marks them 需要联网). Footage from Coverr —\nfree for commercial use, no attribution required."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Launcher and dashboard"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The centre panel lays app cards out by category (cover art, hover motion), with edit and register\nen"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"tries and paging. **Immersive mode** puts the dashboard in the right half — four cards:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Card | Content |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| **AI 热点** | A top-10 of headlines with category tags; the feed ships with the packages |\n| **TOKEN"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" 用量** | Today's and lifetime token counts, switchable by day / week / month, read from your own loca"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"l usage |\n| **今日** | Date plus local weather: city, temperature, high/low, condition |\n| **待办** | Op"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"en to-dos, synced from the right column's to-do panel |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Wallpaper keeps working in immersive mode, with the dashboard over it:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Trending and weather are host-side feeds; to-dos share data with the right column's panel. Where\neac"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"h of those stops is spelled out under\nwhat is in the packages, what is not."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"You need Node.js, **pnpm**, and the `dsh` CLI (the first command below installs `dsh` if you do not\n"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"have it). Nothing else — no clone, no build. `dsh plugin` is a pnpm forwarder underneath, so pnpm\nha"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"s to be on `PATH`; on Windows that is the one piece a fresh Node install leaves out."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"All six packages go in **one** `add`, because only the `harness` package is a profile layer that\nmou"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"nts the other five. Installing them one at a time works too, but only the last one is a layer\nand th"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e rest degrade to plain dependencies."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Every command below is written on a single line, so pasting it line by line works exactly as\nwell as"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" pasting the block whole."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Each command is given twice: once for `bash`/`zsh`, once for Windows. The Windows block calls\n`dsh.c"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"md` and uses no shell-specific syntax at all, so it runs unchanged in `cmd.exe` and in\nPowerShell al"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ike — bare `dsh` does not, because a default PowerShell policy blocks `dsh.ps1`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### No harness yet"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"**macOS / Linux — `bash`, `zsh`**"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**Windows — `cmd.exe` and PowerShell**"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The `--from-default-profile web` step prints the composed profile tree — that is expected, and it\nis"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" why no block redirects output (every shell spells redirection differently). That line creates\n`~/.d"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"sh/profiles/glass` (`%USERPROFILE%\\.dsh\\profiles\\glass` on Windows) carrying the same app\nlayer a st"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"ock `dsh web` profile has; `add` then puts the six packages on top. `glass` is just a\nprofile name —"},{"id":"p35s5","text":" pick another if you like."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### The harness is already installed"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Check the version first:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"If it matches, install — exactly as above, minus the harness install:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**macOS / Linux — `bash`, `zsh`**"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"**Windows — `cmd.exe` and PowerShell**"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**This UI installs into a profile of its own.** Your existing profile — same plugins, same\nsettings "},{"id":"p44s2","text":"— is not touched, and your `dsh` keeps working the way it did. Reach this UI with\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"## What is in the packages, what is not"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"Built against `@deepseek-ai/dsh@0.1.5-rc.2`, verified on `0.1.6-alpha.2`."},{"id":"p48s1","text":"A harness release that adds a row occupying one of the seats this UI registers would collide with\nit"},{"id":"p48s2","text":": the client then fails to load with a single-line `Failed to load plugins` message and nothing\nelse"},{"id":"p48s3","text":" renders. If that happens, the fix lives in this distribution, not in your setup."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
